                                            be/get used to + V-ing	        accustomed to (present)	        He is used to working hard.
                                            be used to + V1	                passive + purpose               Camels are used to carry loads.
                                            be used to + V-ing	            accustomed to (present)	        Camels are used to carrying loads.
